  "_about": "a male lion SCULPTED on the cat frame (2026-11-05, gen: scratchpad sc/carn/gen/lion.py from the tiger's shapes): taller on the leg and shorter in the body than the tiger, a long square muzzle and broad nose; the mane a collar of locks (the coat's quills) from behind the ears over neck, shoulders and chest, golden round the face and dark behind; plain tawny, paler beneath; a long thin tail with a black tuft || THE FACE AND FEET (2026-11-06): one cat's face for both -- the L3 shapes: a rounded cranium and a broad forehead dropping steeply to a short bridge (L3cran, L3brow, L3bridge), broad cheeks, a boxy muzzle with puffy whisker pads creased off the cheek, a white upper lip and chin, a broad nose leather with a dark rim (paints), the lip line and philtrum and a tear line painted, white under the eyes; the eyes forward and frontal (eyeX/eyeY/eyeZ/eyeF on sculpt.eyes); round ears to the side, black-backed and pale inside. faceX: metres his muzzle sits further forward than hers. The paws compact (pawS) with four toe lobes each, about 1.25x the leg above; a carpal bump and a bent pastern at the wrist (wrist); a clear hock with the heel behind it (hock); the thigh tapering to the knee (hind). mesh.cell 1.4cm, 12000 triangles near: the face and toes need it || ROUND 4 (2026-11-06): hs scales every head and ear shape and the eyes about the head joint (her head 1.15); earS/earX/earY/earZ the ears' size and place (hers about twice his old ones, higher and forward, a pale tuft inside); mw the muzzle's width, the whisker pads part of it and the cream a soft paint (L4padCream) grading into the cheek; nS the nose leather; a white lower lip and chin; eyeS the eye (hers .8) under a heavier brow (L4browR) (2026-11-08, ears2.py) The EARS (ears2.py): round cupped sheets (sharp.js `fin`) written over the head's params (the lioness's bigger), dark edged, pale-furred in the hollow; the roots faired. WHISKERS (2026-11-08, tools/creaturegen/sharp/whiskers.py): 16 white whiskers a side, 4 rows on the whisker pad (125-187 mm); 3 white whiskers a side, a brow tuft (46-62 mm) -- `whiskers` shapes (bodyspec.js whiskerStrands: thin pointed strands, mirrored, on the head, near mesh only; details, so every coat and variant still shares one mesh).",
